# Investigative Question

One of the most interesting questions in this case is:

**How do investigators distinguish meaningful transaction activity from hundreds of thousands of transactions intentionally designed to create noise?**

The challenge is rarely finding transactions.

The challenge is identifying which transactions matter.

---

# Publicly Reported Wallet Tracing Methodology

The forfeiture complaint does not focus on a single wallet.

Instead, investigators reportedly identified:

- Collection wallets
- Intermediary wallets
- Consolidation wallets
- Exchange deposit wallets
- Seizable cryptocurrency holdings

through behavioral and transactional analysis.

